       (b) Licensee shall cease all Competing Use within [30] days;
       (c) Fees accrued through the termination date remain due;
       (d) Sections 3, 4.3, 5.3, 6, 7, and 8 survive termination.

   5.4 No Refunds. Unless otherwise agreed, fees paid are non-refundable upon
